    "rebuild is mostly generated output. Without a separate baseline every",
    "generated town becomes 'curated' on the next run, so a place GeoNames",
    "removes or a tightened floor drops would survive forever at weight 1.",
    "Add newly curated cities HERE (and they will survive every rebuild);",
    "JF is absent on purpose — scripts/import_jefferson.py owns it."
